{"id": "85908", "name": "זהות טריגונומטרית – cos(A + x) כ-m·sin x (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Give an expression of the form {{CT:0}} which is equivalent to \\(\\cos\\left({{CT:1}} + x\\right)\\).\n\n\n\n [[input:ans1]] <p>[[validation:ans1]]</p>\n\n <p></p>", "generalfeedback": "Standard trigonometric identities are given below.\n <hint>trig_standard_identities</hint>\n\n The appropriate identity in this case is the angle addition formula:\n\n \\[\\cos\\left(A + B\\right)={{CT:2}} - {{CT:3}},\\]\n\n with \\(A={{CT:1}}\\) and \\(B=x\\). We substitute \\(\\cos\\left({{CT:1}}\\right) = 0\\) and \\(\\sin\\left({{CT:1}}\\right) = {{CT:4}}\\) and find that \\(\\cos\\left({{CT:1}} + x\\right)={{CT:5}} - {{CT:6}}={{CT:7}}\\).", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "answer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-TID-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "GEO-TID-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sin(x)*cos(Aval)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-TID-FALSE-1T", "feedback": "<p>It may be that your answer involves a wrong or incomplete identity for \\(\\cos\\left(A+B\\right)\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "GEO-TID-FALSE-1", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "cos(Aval)+cos(x)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-TID-FALSE-2T", "feedback": "<p>It may be that your answer involves a wrong or incomplete identity for \\(\\cos\\left(A+B\\right)\\). Note it is not true in general that \\(\\cos(A + B) = \\cos(A) + \\cos(B)\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "GEO-TID-FALSE-2 ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mval", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "JUST_M", "feedback": "<p>You were asked to give {{CT:0}}, not just \\(m\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-TID-FALSE-3", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Aval", "answer", "cosAcosB", "cosAvalcosx", "msinx", "mval", "sinAsinB", "sinAvalsinx"], "nvariants": 2}